{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003822","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003822"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003822","label":"子產（伍胥列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"子產","mention_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0115"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0115","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p006","quote":"子產"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-066","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0115"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:p006"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-066-wu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"子產","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003822","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji066-015","person_id":"cbr-p003822","surfaces":["子產"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p006","quote":"伍胥既至宋，宋有華氏之亂，乃與太子建俱奔於鄭。鄭人甚善之。太子建又適晉，晉頃公曰：「太子既善鄭，鄭信太子。太子能為我內應，而我攻其外，滅鄭必矣。滅鄭而封太子。」太子乃還鄭。事未會，會自私欲殺其從者，從者知其謀，乃告之於鄭。鄭定公與子產誅殺太子建。建有子名勝。伍胥懼，乃與勝俱奔吳。到昭關，昭關欲執之。伍胥遂與勝獨身步走，幾不得脫。追者在後。至江，江上有一漁父乘船，知伍胥之急，乃渡伍胥。伍胥既渡，解其劍曰：「此劍直百金，以與父。」父曰：「楚國之法，得伍胥者賜粟五萬石，爵執珪，豈徒百金劍邪！」不受。伍胥未至吳而疾，止中道，乞食。至於吳，吳王僚方用事，公子光為將。伍胥乃因公子光以求見吳王。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名及局部敘事暫接異稱：公子光自立為闔廬、軫立為昭王、勝號白公；王稱隨敘事主體分段。王子綦佯充王不接昭王，與後文司馬子綦暫分候選但不斷言異人。悼公與陽生按本文分存，矛盾待版本覆核；鮑氏不強接鮑牧。未名父子只按本段明示保存，不補姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p006","text":"伍胥既至宋，宋有華氏之亂，乃與太子建俱奔於鄭。鄭人甚善之。太子建又適晉，晉頃公曰：「太子既善鄭，鄭信太子。太子能為我內應，而我攻其外，滅鄭必矣。滅鄭而封太子。」太子乃還鄭。事未會，會自私欲殺其從者，從者知其謀，乃告之於鄭。鄭定公與子產誅殺太子建。建有子名勝。伍胥懼，乃與勝俱奔吳。到昭關，昭關欲執之。伍胥遂與勝獨身步走，幾不得脫。追者在後。至江，江上有一漁父乘船，知伍胥之急，乃渡伍胥。伍胥既渡，解其劍曰：「此劍直百金，以與父。」父曰：「楚國之法，得伍胥者賜粟五萬石，爵執珪，豈徒百金劍邪！」不受。伍胥未至吳而疾，止中道，乞食。至於吳，吳王僚方用事，公子光為將。伍胥乃因公子光以求見吳王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"伍胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"華氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、官署借稱或未定指代，不補姓名或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"鄭人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、官署借稱或未定指代，不補姓名或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"晉頃公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003820","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m006-0080","start":80,"end"